{"3708610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TAKE THEM DOWN", "steam_appid": 3708610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras/33ac4754513c57b79ea72f37f87d7026.avif?t=1771163015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras_big/33ac4754513c57b79ea72f37f87d7026.avif?t=1771163015 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine weapons and abilities in this fast-paced, violent action game to take down necromancers, demons, and betrayers while avoiding being cleaved and crushed by blades, traps, and mines sprawled across nightmarish, macabre levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOT A ROGUELIKE, game features handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras/fb28101099c713c3c8099b523070e883.poster.avif?t=1771163015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras/fb28101099c713c3c8099b523070e883.webm?t=1771163015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras/fb28101099c713c3c8099b523070e883.mp4?t=1771163015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras/c7370575a38f75880068653139a14348.poster.avif?t=1771163015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708610/extras/c7370575a38f75880068653139a14348.webm?t